      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不瞞<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說，\n我又有了新款香水的靈感。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D779E00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAAFF0C000A621153C867094E8665B06B3E99996C3476849748611F300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這次我鎖定的目標\n可是迷你冰噴出的白雪喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B21621193965B9A768476EE6A19000A53EF662F8FF74F6051B0567451FA7684767D96EA5594FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "迷你冰就像霜淇淋那樣\n白白軟軟的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n聞起來會是什麼樣的氣味呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FF74F6051B05C3150CF971C6DC76DCB90A36A23000A767D767D8EDF8EDF76842026202600100001BE00000A805E8D774F866703662F4EC09EBC6A2376846C23547354622026202600100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以的話，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶一隻迷你冰來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE576848A71FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E364E0096BB8FF74F6051B04F865427FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳如果有捉到迷你冰，\n請將牠加入到同行隊伍裡再來！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
