    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我把迷你冰\n帶來了呀！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B6211628A8FF74F6051B0000A5E364F864E865440FF0100100001BE00000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我這就來採一點\n迷你冰的雪！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C621190195C314F8663A14E009EDE000A8FF74F6051B0768496EAFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好、好冰啊！真不愧是\n會吐出零下50度冷氣的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
