      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雪一般來說是不會有氣味的，\n但來自寶可夢的雪應該就有辦法……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96EA4E00822C4F868AAA662F4E0D670367096C2354737684FF0C000A4F464F8681EA5BF653EF5922768496EA61C98A725C3167098FA66CD520262026FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "迷你冰的香水完成了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FF74F6051B0768499996C345B8C62104E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到！迷你冰的雪\n帶有淡淡甜～甜的香氣呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D5230FF018FF74F6051B0768496EA000A5E3667096DE16DE1751CFF5E751C768499996C235462FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過聞著這個香味，\n身體就會奇妙地越～來越涼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E805E84579019500B99995473FF0C000A8EAB9AD45C3167035947599957308D8AFF5E4F868D8A6DBC300200100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有預感它會在南方的\n阿羅拉地區大受歡迎！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我看到寶可夢香水的可能性了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167099810611F5B8367035728535765B97684000A963F7F8562C957305340592753D76B618FCEFF0100100001BE00000A6211770B52305BF653EF592299996C34768453EF80FD60274E86FF0100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢的香水潛藏著無限的可能性！\n要是又有什麼事，就再麻煩<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳囉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
